  "limitations": [
    "B01: measured monthly energy only for 2024-01..2025-10 (study workbook, sheet 8.ELOR) with the peak split from same-year Office peers; 2025-11/12 are modeled from B01 2025 months. B_01.csv is project-generated and excluded.",
    "B01 2023 (training year) is a declared backcast: 2024 measured monthly profile x 0.98 (original method). It uses validation-year information; its months carry cross_year_leakage_declared and a sensitivity excluding modeled buildings is required.",
    "Missing months are modeled within the same year; hourly shapes are generated, not measured.",
    "Weather is NASA POWER reanalysis for one grid point, not a local station.",
    "PEN/USD uses the annual official average (World Bank); monthly variation is not represented.",
    "TotalFacturado is assumed to be in PEN; the peak/off-peak price ratio 0.38/0.26 is a project assumption.",
    "Carbon intensity is a modeled diesel-system factor, not an hourly measurement.",
    "EV sessions, controlled machines, PV and BESS sizes are modeled with the project tools."
  ]
}